---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon";
import ContentSection from "~/components/content-section.astro";
---

<ContentSection title="Enterprise-Grade Wellness" id="intro">
  <Icon slot="eyebrow" name="fitme-logo" class="h-32" />
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    FitME-gRPC is an <span class="text-primary">enterprise rewrite</span> of the original FitME REST API.
    Built with <span class="text-primary">Go and gRPC</span>, it delivers
    <span class="text-primary">microservice-based</span> fitness, nutrition, and mental health services.
  </Fragment>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <a
      href="https://github.com/your-repo/fitme-grpc"
      class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border-2 border-current px-6 py-4 hover:bg-primary/10 transition-colors"
    >
      <Icon pack="mdi" name="github" class="h-8" />
      <span>View Source</span>
    </a>
    <a
      href="#tech-stack"
      class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border-2 border-current px-6 py-4 hover:bg-primary/10 transition-colors"
    >
      <Icon pack="mdi" name="layers-triple" class="h-8" />
      <span>Tech Stack</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</ContentSection>
